eln und Alltagsprodukten in Deutschland und \xd6sterreich. Das Unternehmen stellt Partnern eine Plattform, Infrastruktur sowie zahlreiche Services f\xfcr ihr digitales Bestellgesch\xe4ft bereit und erleichtert Konsument:innen die Bestellung per App. Dar\xfcber hinaus bietet Lieferando einen Logistikdienst mit festangestellten Fahrer:innen f\xfcr Partner ohne eigenen Lieferservice.",address:{postalCode:"1010",streetAddress:"Kohlmarkt 8/10",addressLocality:"Wien",addressCountry:v.CountryCodes.AT},sameAs:["https://www.facebook.com/Lieferando.at/","https://www.instagram.com/lieferandoat","https://www.youtube.com/@lieferando.atonlineessenbe2933"],foundingDate:"2000"}},{TAKEAWAY_COM:j}=C.supportedDomains,{TAKEAWAY:S}=C.brandNames,T={organization:{name:S,url:{default:`https://${A.c.createDefaultSubdomainHost(j)}/be`,fr:`https://${A.c.createDefaultSubdomainHost(j)}/be-fr/`},logoUrl:"https://www.takeaway.com/consumer-web/images/takeaway-brand.b40b588c.svg",description:{default:"Bij Takeaway.com weten we wat gemak is. Of het nu gaat om pizza op vrijdagavond, een poke bowl na de sportschool, of het halen van boodschappen, we staan met slechts een klik bij je voor de deur. En nu bezorgen we zelfs nog meer!",fr:"Chez Takeaway.com, nous savons ce qu'est la commodit\xe9. Qu'il s'agisse d'une pizza le vendredi soir, d'un poke bowl apr\xe8s la gym ou de courses, nous sommes \xe0 votre porte en un clic. Et maintenant, nous livrons encore plus !"},address:{default:{postalCode:"1000",streetAddress:"Bd Baudouin 29",addressLocality:"Bruxelles",addressCountry:v.CountryCodes.BE}},sameAs:["https://www.facebook.com/timefortakeaway","https://www.instagram.com/takeaway.combe","https://twitter.com/TakeawaycomBE","https://www.youtube.com/c/pizzabe"],foundingDate:"2000"}},{TAKEAWAY_COM:L}=C.supportedDomains,{TAKEAWAY:_}=C.brandNames,U={organization:{name:_,url:`https://${A.c.createDefaultSubdomainHost(L)}/bg`,logoUrl:"https://www.takeaway.com/consumer-web/images/takeaway-brand.b40b588c.svg",description:"От пица до пад тай, от индийска до италианска кухня - Takeaway е най-лесният и бърз начин да поръчате храна за вкъщи онлайн, на своя смартфон или таблет.  Открийте местните ресторанти и поръчайте с доставка или за събиране. Плащайте в брой или сигурно с дебитни и кредитни карти.",address:{postalCode:"1404",streetAddress:"109, Bulgaria Blvd., floor -1, office 27 Manastirski Livadi Quarter",addressLocality:"Sofia",addressCountry:v.CountryCodes.BG},sameAs:["https://twitter.com/takeawaycombg","https://www.facebook.com/TakeawaycomBG/","https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCM1QOg3YfCmfszGXvwErHPw","https://www.instagram.com/takeawaycom_bg/"],foundingDate:"2004"}},{JUST_EAT_CH:J}=C.supportedDomains,{JUST_EAT:B}=C.brandNames,N={organization:{name:B,url:{default:`https://${A.c.createDefaultSubdomainHost(J)}`,fr:`https://${A.c.createDefaultSubdomainHost(J)}/fr/`},logoUrl:"https://www.just-eat.ch/consumer-web/images/just-eat-brand.70859c03.svg",description:{default:"Just Eat ist ein erfolgreicher Onlinemarktplatz zum Bestellen von Essen, Lebensmitteln und Alltagsprodukten in der Schweiz. Das Unternehmen stellt Partnern eine Plattform, Infrastruktur sowie zahlreiche Services f\xfcr ihr digitales Bestellgesch\xe4ft bereit und erleichtert Konsument:innen die Bestellung per App. Dar\xfcber hinaus bietet Just Eat einen Logistikdienst mit festangestellten Fahrer:innen f\xfcr Partner ohne eigenen Lieferservice.",fr:"Just Eat est une place de march\xe9 en ligne \xe0 succ\xe8s pour commander de la nourriture, des produits d'\xe9picerie et des produits du quotidien en Suisse. L'entreprise fournit \xe0 ses partenaires une plate-forme, une infrastructure et de nombreux services pour leur activit\xe9 de commande num\xe9rique et facilite la commande des consommateurs via une application. De plus, Just Eat propose un service logistique avec chauffeurs permanents pour les partenaires ne disposant pas de leur propre service de livraison."},address:{default:{postalCode:"8045",streetAddress:"Manessestrasse 85",addressLocality:"Z\xfcrich",addressCountry:v.CountryCodes.CH}},sameAs:["https://www.youtube.com/c/JustEatSwitzerland","https://www.instagram.com/justeatch","https://www.facebook.com/JustEatCH"],foundingDate:"2007"}},{LIEFERANDO_DE:x}=C.supportedDomains,{LIEFERANDO:P}=C.brandNames,$={organization:{name:P,url:`https://${A.c.createDefaultSubdomainHost(x)}`,logoUrl:"https://www.lieferando.de/consumer-web/images/lieferando-brand.06ee84e9.svg",description:"Lieferando ist ein erfolgreicher Onlinemarktplatz zum Bestellen von Essen, Lebensmitteln und Alltagsprodukten in Deutschland und \xd6sterreich. Das Unternehmen stellt Partnern eine Plattform, Infrastruktur sowie zahlreiche Services f\xfcr ihr digitales Bestellgesch\xe4ft bereit und erleichtert Konsument:innen die Bestellung per App. Dar\xfcber hinaus bietet Lieferando einen Logistikdienst mit festangestellten Fahrer:innen f\xfcr Partner ohne eigenen Lieferservice.",address:{postalCode:"10997",streetAddress:"Cuvrystr. 50, 52, 54 / Schlesische Str. 34",addressLocality:"Berlin",addressCountry:v.CountryCodes.DE},sameAs:["https://www.facebook.com/lieferando/","https://www.instagram.com/lieferando","https://www.youtube.com/@lieferando"],foundingDate:"2009"}},{JUST_EAT_DK:O}=C.supportedDomains,{JUST_EAT:I}=C.brandNames,H={organization:{name:I,url:`https://${A.c.createDefaultSubdomainHost(O)}`,logoUrl:"https://www.just-eat.dk/consumer-web/images/just-eat-brand.70859c03.svg",description:"Just Eat er en succesfuld online markedsplads for bestilling af mad, dagligvarer og hverdagsprodukter i Danmark. Just Eat giver partnere en platform, infrastruktur og adskillige tjenester til deres digitale bestillingsforretning og g\xf8r det nemmere for forbrugerne at bestille online og via app. Just Eat tilbyder ogs\xe5 en logistikservice med faste chauff\xf8rer til partnere uden egen leveringsservice.",address:{postalCode:"2100",streetAddress:"Lyngbyvej 20",addressLocality:"K\xf8benhavn",addressCountry:v.CountryCodes.DK},sameAs:["https://www.facebook.com/JustEatDK","https://www.instagram.com/justeatdk","https://www.youtube.com/user/JustEatDK"],foundingDate:"01/08/2001"}},{JUST_EAT_ES:K}=C.supportedDomains,{JUST_EAT:R}=C.brandNames,q={organization:{name:R,url:`https://${A.c.createDefaultSubdomainHost(K)}`,logoUrl:"https://www.just-eat.es/consumer-web/images/just-eat-brand.70859c03.svg",description:"Desde pizza hasta helado, hamburguesas, kebabs, pasta, sushi, comida china, pizza a domicilio, comida mexicana y mucho m\xe1s. Just Eat es la forma m\xe1s f\xe1cil y r\xe1pida de pedir comida para llevar y hacer tus compras en l\xednea, ya sea en tu tel\xe9fono inteligente o tableta. Descubre restaurantes locales y haz tu pedido para entrega o recogida. Paga en efectivo o de forma segura con tarjeta de d\xe9bito o cr\xe9dito.",address:{postalCode:"40- 28045",streetAddress:"Calle del \xc1ncora",addressLocality:"Madrid",addressCountry:v.CountryCodes.ES},sameAs:["https://www.facebook.com/JustEat.es","https://www.instagram.com/justeat_es/","https://twitter.com/JustEat_es","https://www.youtube.com/@JustEatEspana"],foundingDate:"2010"}},{JUST_EAT_FR:F}=C.supportedDomains,{JUST_EAT:M}=C.brandNames,W={organization:{name:M,url:`https://${A.c.createDefaultSubdomainHost(F)}`,logoUrl:"https://www.just-eat.fr/consumer-web/images/just-eat-brand.70859c03.svg",description:"Just Eat est l'un des leaders mondiaux de la livraison de repas. Avec plus de 60 sp\xe9cialit\xe9s, Just Eat r\xe9unit tous vos restaurants pr\xe9f\xe9r\xe9s (enseignes embl\xe9matiques ou p\xe9pites de quartier). Pr\xe9sent dans plus de 2500 communes dans l'Hexagone, Just Eat a \xe9galement lanc\xe9 son service de livraison op\xe9r\xe9 par des livreurs salari\xe9s dans la plupart des grandes villes fran\xe7aises.",address:{postalCode:"75015",streetAddress:"2Ter Rue Louis Armand",addressLocality:"Paris",addressCountry:v.CountryCodes.FR},sameAs:["https://www.facebook.com/JustEatFrance","https://www.instagram.com/JustEatFr","https://twitter.com/JustEatFr","https://www.youtube.com/@JustEatFrance"],foundingDate:"1998"}},{JUST_EAT_CO_UK:Y}=C.supportedDomains,{JUST_EAT:G}=C.brandNames,Q={organization:{name:G,url:`https://${A.c.createDefaultSubdomainHost(Y)}`,logoUrl:"https://www.just-eat.co.uk/apple-touch-icon-180x180.png",description:"From pizza to pad thai, Indian to Italian, Just Eat is the easiest and fastest way to order takeaway online, on your smartphone or on your tablet. Rooting around in cluttered drawers for paper takeaway menus is a thing of the past, and awkward phone orders have gone the way of video rental stores. Discover local restaurants and order for delivery or collection. Pay by cash or securely by debit and credit card.",address:{postalCode:"EC4M 7RF",streetAddress:"2 Fleet Place",addressLocality:"London",addressCountry:v.CountryCodes.GB},sameAs:["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Just_Eat","https://www.facebook.com/justeat","https://twitter.com/JustEatUK","https://www.youtube.com/user/TVjusteat"],foundingDate:"01/08/2001"}},{JUST_EAT_IE:X}=C.supportedDomains,{JUST_EAT:Z}=C.brandNames,V={organization:{name:Z,url:`https://${A.c.createDefaultSubdomainHost(X)}`,logoUrl:"https://www.just-eat.ie/apple-touch-icon-180x180.png",description:"From pizza to pad thai, Indian to Italian, Just Eat is the easiest and fastest way to order takeaway online, on your smartphone or on your tablet. Rooting around in cluttered drawers for paper takeaway menus is a thing of the past, and awkward phone orders have gone the way of video rental stores. Discover local restaurants and order for delivery or collection. Pay by cash or securely by debit and credit card.",address:{postalCode:"D04 A4EO",streetAddress:"35 Shelbourne Road Ballsbridge",addressLocality:"Dublin",addressCountry:v.CountryCodes.IE},sameAs:["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Just_Eat","https://www.facebook.com/JustEatIreland/","https://www.instagram.com/justeatie/","https://twitter.com/justeatie","https://www.youtube.com/c/JustEatIRL"],foundingDate:"01/04/2008"}},{JUST_EAT_IT:ee}=C.supportedDomains,{JUST_EAT:et}=C.brandNames,ea={organization:{name:et,url:`https://${A.c.createDefaultSubdomainHost(ee)}`,logoUrl:"https://www.justeat.it/consumer-web/images/just-eat-brand.70859c03.svg",description:"Pizza, gelato, hamburger, kebab, pasta, sushi, spesa e molto altro. Just Eat \xe8 il modo pi\xf9 facile e veloce per ordinare cibo da asporto e fare la tua spesa online, sul tuo smartphone o sul tuo tablet. Scopri ristoranti, locali e ordina per la consegna o il ritiro. Paga in contanti o in modo sicuro con carta di debito o di credito.",address:{postalCode:"23 – 20124",streetAddress:"Via De Castillia",addressLocality:"Milano",addressCountry:v.CountryCodes.IT},sameAs:["https://www.facebook.com/justeatitaly","https://www.instagram.com/justeat_it/","https://twitter.com/justeattakeaway","https://www.tiktok.com/@justeat_italia","https://www.youtube.com/@JustEatItalia"],foundingDate:"2011"}},{TAKEAWAY_COM:es}=C.supportedDomains,{TAKEAWAY:er}=C.brandNames,en={organization:{name:er,url:`https://${A.c.createDefaultSubdomainHost(es)}/lu`,logoUrl:"https://www.takeaway.com/consumer-web/images/takeaway-brand.b40b588c.svg",description:"Chez Takeaway.com, nous savons ce qu'est la commodit\xe9. Qu'il s'agisse d'une pizza le vendredi soir, d'un poke bowl apr\xe8s la gym ou de courses, nous sommes \xe0 votre porte en un clic. Et maintenant, nous livrons encore plus !",address:{postalCode:"1000",streetAddress:"Bd Baudouin 29",addressLocality:"Bruxelles",addressCountry:v.CountryCodes.BE},sameAs:["https://twitter.com/TakeawaycomLU","https://www.instagram.com/takeaway.com_lux","https://www.facebook.com/timefortakeaway"],foundingDate:"2000"}},{THUISBEZORGD_NL:eo}=C.supportedDomains,{THUISBEZORGD:ei}=C.brandNames,ed={organization:{name:ei,url:`https://${A.c.createDefaultSubdomainHost(eo)}`,logoUrl:"https://www.thuisbezorgd.nl/consumer-web/images/nl-thuisbezorgd-brand.d728639c.svg",description:"Bij Thuisbezorgd.nl weten we wat gemak is. Of het nu gaat om pizza op vrijdagavond, een poke bowl na de sportschool, of het halen van boodschappen, we staan met slechts een klik bij je voor de deur. En nu bezorgen we zelfs nog meer!",address:{postalCode:"1019 GM",streetAddress:"Piet Heinkade 61",addressLocality:"Amsterdam",addressCountry:v.CountryCodes.NL},sameAs:["https://www.instagram.com/thuisbezorgd.nl/","https://www.facebook.com/thuisbezorgd/","https://www.youtube.com/user/Thuisbezorgd"],foundingDate:"2000"}},{PYSZNE_PL:eu}=C.supportedDomains,{PYSZNE_PL:el}=C.brandNames,ec={organization:{name:el,url:`https://${A.c.createDefaultSubdomainHost(eu)}`,logoUrl:"https://www.pyszne.pl/consumer-web/images/pl-pyszne-brand.f7cd9627.svg",description:"W Pyszne.pl wiemy, czym jest wygoda. Niezależnie od tego, czy chodzi o pizzę w piątkowy wiecz\xf3r, miskę poke po siłowni, jesteśmy na wyciągnięcie ręki za jednym kliknięciem. A teraz dostarczamy jeszcze więcej!",address:{postalCode:"53-332",streetAddress:"Powstańc\xf3w Śląskich 9",addressLocality:"Wrocław",addressCountry:v.CountryCodes.PL},sameAs:["https://twitter.com/pysznepl","https://www.facebook.com/pysznepl/","https://www.instagram.com/pysznepl/","https://www.youtube.com/pysznepl"],foundingDate:"01/02/2010"}},{BISTRO_SK:ep}=C.supportedDomains,{BISTRO_SK:em}=C.brandNames,ew={organization:{name:em,url:`https://${A.c.createDefaultSubdomainHost(ep)}`,logoUrl:"https://www.bistro.sk/consumer-web/images/bistro-brand.1dcac3dc.svg",description:"Don\xe1ška Bistro.sk - objednaj si jedlo z pohodlia domova. Rozvoz a don\xe1ška až k tebe domov. Objednaj si svoje obľ\xfaben\xe9 jedlo online",address:{postalCode:"811 09",streetAddress:"Bottova 2A",addressLocality:"Bratislava - mestsk\xe1 časť Star\xe9 Mesto",addressCountry:v.CountryCodes.SK},sameAs:["https://www.instagram.com/bistro_sk","https://www.facebook.com/bistrodonaska","https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZr9WQMWp5SSOMKI8gQzf7g"],foundingDate:"2013"}},{TEN_BIS:eg}=C.supportedDomains,{TEN_BIS:ef}=C.brandNames,eh={organization:{nam